    {
        "command": "name",
        "value": "Director",
        "text": "Wonderful, Nyamu! That's exactly the feeling I was going for!"
    },
    {
        "command": "name",
        "value": "Director",
        "text": "An ordinary village girl leaves everything behind on a journey to pursue her musical dreams."
    },
    {
        "command": "name",
        "value": "Director",
        "text": "This scene is her darkest moment. After this, a serendipitous encounter sets her on the path to becoming Lungmen's favorite musician."
    },
    {
        "command": "charslot",
        "params": {
            "slot": "m",
            "name": "avg_4185_amoris_1#8$3",
            "focus": "m"
        }
    },
    {
        "command": "name",
        "value": "Nyamu Y\u016btenji",
        "text": "Appreciate the compliment, D~"
    },
    {
        "command": "name",
        "value": "Nyamu Y\u016btenji",
        "text": "Dunno why, but when I read the script, I found myself really identifying with the heroine."
    },
    {
        "command": "dialog"
    },
    {
        "command": "charslot"
    },
    {
        "command": "name",
        "value": "Director",
        "text": "Of course! It was tailor-written just for you, Miss Nyamu!"
    },
    {
        "command": "name",
        "value": "Scriptwriter",
        "text": "*Shangshu dialect* Yeah right... like we didn't rewrite it in a rush to make the New Year screening..."
    },
    {
        "command": "charslot",
        "params": {
            "slot": "m",
            "name": "avg_4185_amoris_1#1$3",
            "focus": "m"
        }
    },
    {
        "command": "name",
        "value": "Nyamu Y\u016btenji",
        "text": "Huh...?"
    },
    {
        "command": "dialog"
    },
    {
        "command": "charslot"
    },
    {
        "command": "name",
        "value": "Scriptwriter",
        "text": "The investors saw the success of <i>The Drummer Girl</i> and demanded we cast you for the lead role."
    },
    {
        "command": "name",
        "value": "Scriptwriter",
        "text": "Then your agency wanted the movie out for the New Year screening, so the director here made me rewrite the script in a week..."
    },
    {
        "command": "name",
        "value": "Scriptwriter",
        "text": "In the original ending... the girl was meant to have this phantasmagoric dream in her dying moments."
    },
    {
        "command": "name",
        "value": "Scriptwriter",
        "text": "Under a blaze of dazzling lights, an unremarkable girl staggered her way onto the awards podium."
    },
    {
        "command": "name",
        "value": "Scriptwriter",
        "text": "There, in her dream, she finally won everyone's recognition and made peace with everything."
    },
    {
        "command": "name",
        "value": "Scriptwriter",
        "text": "That's what the ending was supposed to be! A savage, ironic satire!"
    },
    {
        "command": "name",
        "value": "Director",
        "text": "<i>Ding nei goh fai</i>, you think that trash you wrote would've got funding like this without Nyamu's name value?"
    },
    {
        "command": "name",
        "value": "Scriptwriter",
        "text": "Who gives a shake about your funding? You've been kissing sponsors' asses for so long, you've forgotten how to make art!"
    },
    {
        "command": "name",
        "value": "Scriptwriter",
        "text": "Stories like this just don't come true! Ordinary people never just get the chance to step into the spotlight!"
    },
    {
        "command": "camerashake",
        "params": {
            "duration": 0.3,
            "xstrength": 30,
            "ystrength": 30,
